      "text": "We counsel student about the curriculum and help in choosing right universities. We assist students in obtaining passports and collect documents required for visa process. Student is ready to fly once the student submits all the related documents to the university and get permit from the migration. We being official representative partners of the universities will fly with the students and drop them at their respective universities. Student convenience matter a lot for us, we don’t leave the place until the student settles.",
